<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gĕōmē^trĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωμετρικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			geometry</i>, <i>geometrical</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">geometricum quiddam explicare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 2, 59, 122</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaedam de dimensione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 1, 24, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rep. 1, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ac. 2, 36, 117</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gĕōmē^trĭcus</span></b> ,
			i. m., <i>a geometer</i>, <i>geometrician</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reprehensi a geometricis sunt historici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 10, 40</span></i>
			 Spald. <i>N. cr.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gĕōmē^trĭce</span></b> ,
				ēs, f., <i>geometry</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 10, 36, § 76</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Vitr. 10, 11,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gĕōmē^trĭ-ca</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>geometry</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">geometrica discere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 1, 6, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem interrogare quaedam geometrica de
					dimensione quadrati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 1, 24, 57</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
